            "summary": "The skill's stated purpose (local SherpaDesk backend + OpenClaw skill-front) matches the bundled code and runtime instructions, but the package metadata omits expected credential and install declarations and the bundle will install/run a persistent local service — these mismatches merit caution before installing.",
