                "detail": "The SKILL.md and README clearly describe a backend that authenticates to SherpaDesk and requires an API token and local runtime state. Yet the registry metadata lists no required environment variables or primary credential. The bundle is not purely 'instruction-only' — it includes a full Python implementation (src/, scripts/, pyproject.toml) that implements networked API access, DB storage, and a background service. The declared metadata is therefore incomplete and inconsistent with the skill's actual purpose.",
