              {
                "detail": "Registry shows no install spec, but the repo contains bootstrap (scripts/bootstrap.py) and run (scripts/run.py) entrypoints and a pyproject/requirements, so following the SKILL.md will create a Python venv and install packages from PyPI and may register a systemd user unit. The absence of an explicit install spec in the registry combined with executable bootstrap code is an inconsistency worth flagging: running bootstrap will write files, install packages (network downloads), and create persistent artifacts.",
                "label": "Install Mechanism",
